{"id":"d_main_39_06","cat":"main","group":{"id":"ch39","label":"Chapter 39 · Gene"},"label":"The Fourth Member","stage":"39-19 STAGE · Start","prev":"d_main_39_05","next":"d_main_39_07","speakers":{"nayuta_n":"Nayuta","rapi_red":"Rapi","maxwell_p":"Maxwell","laplace_p":"Laplace","drake_p":"Drake"},"icons":{"nayuta_n":"si_c9008_00_s","rapi_red":"si_c016_00_s","maxwell_p":"si_c105_00_s","laplace_p":"si_c103_00_s","drake_p":"si_c104_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_main_39_06_1","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_1","text":"I've never heard of the Pioneer Squad having any other members.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"RaptilionFarm","bgArt":"raptilionfarm","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_halo","movie":null,"shown":["nayuta_n","rapi_red"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_2","text":"I am the fourth member of the Forerunner Squad, moving with one accord alongside White Snow, Persinette, and Scarlet.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_3","text":"Yet, 'tis not so that I act in constant company with them. I attend not the regular gatherings, but act of mine own accord.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_4","text":"One might say we assemble only when grave matters call for discourse.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_5","text":"Well... seeing how tight-lipped those three are, 'tis no wonder thou hast heard naught of me, so it is.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_6","text":"I find that hard to believe.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_7","text":"Pretending to be a Pilgrim isn't exactly difficult.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_8","text":"That is indeed the truth. To impersonate a Pilgrim is a task most easy.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_9","text":"Whether ye believe it or not, that is the choice of thee.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_10","text":"For verily, the heart of a person is not to be commanded at will.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_11","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_11","text":"How did you know I knew the Pioneers?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_12","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_12","text":"You clearly recognize me, but I'm positive the Pioneers don't have any photos of me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_13","text":"Verily, Persinette doth possess a portrait of thee.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_14","text":"On several occasions, I have beheld her crafting prurient images inspired by that likeness, so it is.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_15","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_15","text":"??","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_16","text":"I'm not quite sure what you're getting at.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_17","text":"She hath sketched drawings most lewd.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_18","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_18","text":"What?!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_19","text":"Tell her to turn them in at once!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_20","text":"I knew not that the human body was capable of so many postures, verily.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_21","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_21","text":"That's enough!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_22","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_22","text":"Okay, then tell me about Snow White's characteristics.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_23","text":"Rather than discourse at length, allow me to show thee a token of hers.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_24","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_24","text":"Nayuta takes something out from her robe and hands it to me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_25","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_25","text":"It is a black orb about the size of a ping pong ball,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_26","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_26","text":"mostly soft and squishy but with some hard parts here and there.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_27","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_27","text":"What's this?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_28","text":"'Tis a dumpling of centipedes and spiders, verily. It hath been naturally dried, and save for certain parts, remaineth soft.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_29","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_29","text":"Gah!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_30","text":"As for Scarlet, she is naught but a drunkard.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_31","text":"Verily, a tale hath reached mine ears concerning thee and Scarlet.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_32","text":"By mischance, thou camest to the surface, and toiled in the fields with Scarlet...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_33","text":"What was it again? Didst thou not partake of fertilizer, perchance?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_34","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_34","text":"I think you mean we made fertilizer.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_35","text":"Ah, indeed. It would seem I was mistaken.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_36","text":"Yet even so, hath this not lent some measure of credence to my tale?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_37","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_37","text":"... I believe so.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_38","text":"If anything, it'd be more suspicious if you weren't a Pioneer at this point.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_39","text":"This is indeed a joyous occasion.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_40","text":"The pleasure of our meeting had so enraptured me that I had quite forgotten to enquire...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_41","text":"Pray tell, what brings you to this place?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_42","text":"We're here to see Raptilion.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_43","text":"Ah, now that I recall, thou art a close friend of Harmonizer as well. Truly, thy connections are far and wide.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_44","text":"The Commander doesn't discriminate.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_45","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_45","text":"How do you know all this?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_46","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_47","text":"The Harmonizer hath gone briefly to welcome some guests. I know the way and shall guide thee. Pray, follow me hence.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_48","text":"Who else is here?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_49","text":"They were bold young ladies clad in black oil. To this humble one, they appeared as unwelcome guests, yet Harmonizer regards them as honored visitors.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_50","text":"Verily, even that befits Harmonizer's nature.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_51","text":"!!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_52","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_52","text":"If the Four Beasts meet up with Raptilion...!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_53","text":"That means...!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_54","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_54","text":"... Actually, I don't think anything that bad would happen.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_whosdumber","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_55","text":"Yeah, me neither.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_56","text":"Haha. Such is the power of the Harmonizer, is it not?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_57","text":"Now then, we shall depart.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["maxwell_p","laplace_p","drake_p"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_58","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_59","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_60","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_61","text":"Ah, a grave oversight on my part. I have yet to exchange greetings with you, ladies.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_62","text":"Might I have the honor of knowing your names?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_63","text":"P-Pilg... *Cough cough*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_64","text":"Good grief...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_65","text":"Tch, I've got zero interest in people who are so obviously nice guys.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_66","text":"Huh? You can talk again?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_67","text":"Heh. As long as I don't shout, I can at least hold a conversation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_68","text":"This young lady hath a voice most villainous.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_69","text":"... Excuse me?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_70","text":"Even thy outward guise doth resemble that of a villain, making thee all the more villainous.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_71","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_72","text":"Not bad, I'll give you that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_73","text":"Nice to meet you, Pilgrim. We're the Matis Squad from Missilis.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_74","text":"I'm Maxwell. That blue one over there is Laplace, and the red one's Drake.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_75","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_75","text":"They kind of screamed themselves hoarse, so you'll have to forgive them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_76","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_76","text":"Is that so? I hath thought it their natural voice.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_77","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_77","text":"Pray, grant me but a moment.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_78","text":"Hmm?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_79","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_79","text":"Nayuta slowly walks up to Laplace and Drake.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_80","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_80","text":"She reaches out and touches their throats with her fingers.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_81","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_81","text":"*Zap*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_halo","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_82","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_82","text":"A golden light erupts from Nayuta's fingers.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_83","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_83","text":"...!!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_84","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_84","text":"What are you doing?!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_85","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_85","text":"!!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_86","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_86","text":"!!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_87","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_87","text":"Heroic vocal cords, restored!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_88","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_88","text":"Darn it... I liked my voice being all raspy. It made me sound more villainous.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_89","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_89","text":"...?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_90","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_90","text":"There we go. It seems it has gone well, verily.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_91","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_91","text":"Holy cow! An honest-to-goodness Pilgrim, in the flesh! I can't believe it!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_92","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_92","text":"Oh! Your eyes are closed! Your hair is white, and really long at that!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_93","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_93","text":"...!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_94","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_94","text":"You're a Nikke!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_95","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_95","text":"Don't you have any filters at all?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_96","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_96","text":"... So much for peace and quiet.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_97","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_97","text":"It gladdens me to know thou art curious about one such as myself. However, meeting the Harmonizer takes precedence.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_98","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_98","text":"Might we converse as we walk?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_99","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_99","text":"How come one of your arms looks different?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_100","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_100","text":"What are you hiding? If you've got retractable claws, I'll let you be a member of the Villain Union!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_101","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_101","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_102","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_102","text":"Haha, I thank thee.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_103","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_103","text":"Come, let us be on our way.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_104","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_104","text":"Nayuta begins walking calmly","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_105","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_105","text":"with Laplace and Drake clinging to her sides.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_106","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_106","text":"Hey! What are you two doing?!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_107","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_107","text":"How long have you been on the surface?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_108","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_108","text":"Haha. Thou art too generous with thy praise.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_109","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_109","text":"?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_110","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_110","text":"Have you ever seen the Lift?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_111","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_111","text":"Haha. Thou speakest too kindly.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_112","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_112","text":"?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_113","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_113","text":"Tell me about your battles on the surface! How many battles, how many wins? And what weapon do you use?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_114","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_114","text":"Haha. Thy words ring true.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_115","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_115","text":"???","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_116","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_116","text":"Do you have any interest in villains? If you want, I can give you some recommendations.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_117","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_117","text":"Haha. Thy words are duly noted.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_118","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_118","text":"???","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_119","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_119","text":"I suppose that's one way to deflect inane questions.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_120","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_120","text":"Maxwell, did you see that?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_121","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_121","text":"That golden flash of light? Yeah, but what was it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_122","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_122","text":"I was hoping you'd know. It's the first time I've seen it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_123","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_123","text":"... Or is it really?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_124","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_124","text":"??","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_125","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_125","text":"The Four Beasts, a former Heretic, Mother Whale, and even a Pilgrim. Life on the surface really is a blast, huh?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_126","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_126","text":"Do things always get this wild for you, Cutey?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_127","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_127","text":"More or less.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_128","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_128","text":"Maybe I should just quit Matis and join the Counters.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_06_129","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_06_129","text":"There's no end to the drama. Seriously.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}